<component type="driver">
  <id>nvidia-utils</id>
  <name>NVIDIA Userspace Driver Components</name>
  <summary>NVIDIA accelerated Linux Graphics Driver userspace components</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      The NVIDIA Accelerated Linux Graphics Driver brings accelerated 2D
      functionality and high-performance OpenGL and Vulkan support to Linux
      with the use of NVIDIA graphics processing units.
    </p>
    <p>
      This package provides the userspace components - libraries, Xorg driver,
      Vulkan ICD, VDPAU, CUDA runtime, NVENC/NVDEC, and management utilities
      shared by the various NVIDIA kernel driver variants.
    </p>
  </description>
